WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.373 --> 00:00:03.390
Unit eighteen. Fire Emergencies!

2
00:00:04.342 --> 00:00:08.116
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:08.166 --> 00:00:11.648
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.698 --> 00:00:15.444
Today we learn about Fire Emergencies. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.212 --> 00:00:19.795
Fire. Say it with me. Fire!

6
00:00:23.305 --> 00:00:26.555
Smoke. Say it with me. Smoke!

7
00:00:30.038 --> 00:00:33.855
Alarm. Say it with me. Alarm!

8
00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.587
Exit. Say it with me. Exit!

9
00:00:44.096 --> 00:00:47.379
Crawl. Say it with me. Crawl!

10
00:00:50.881 --> 00:00:55.315
Stop drop roll. Say it with me. Stop drop roll!

11
00:00:58.804 --> 00:01:03.121
Meeting place. Say it with me. Meeting place!

12
00:01:06.631 --> 00:01:09.914
Call. Say it with me. Call!

13
00:01:13.472 --> 00:01:23.346
If there is a fire, I leave quickly using the nearest exit. I crawl under smoke and meet my family at our meeting place. If my clothes catch fire, I stop, drop, and roll.

14
00:01:23.396 --> 00:01:24.585
I can do that too!

15
00:01:25.821 --> 00:01:30.857
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.907 --> 00:01:32.057
Alarm!

17
00:01:33.019 --> 00:01:38.288
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.338 --> 00:01:39.678
Meeting place!

19
00:01:40.748 --> 00:01:46.730
Did you know? A smoke alarm can give a family extra minutes to get out safely!

20
00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:48.684
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:49.376 --> 00:01:57.219
Think and answer. What should you do if your clothes catch fire?

22
00:01:57.269 --> 00:01:58.419
Great answer!

23
00:01:59.510 --> 00:02:04.459
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:04.509 --> 00:02:07.166
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

